{"ID":"20250806125521-39qlehk","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f684","id":"20250806125521-39qlehk","title":"UP——Unity性能优化笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20251126113530"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806125621-a90n2vw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250806125621-a90n2vw","updated":"20251126113530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 性能优化"}]},{"ID":"20250806125633-ay2ecs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806125633-ay2ecs4","updated":"20250806125706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"笔记代号 UP —— Unity Performance 的缩写"}]},{"ID":"20251126113256-ryjm6ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251126113256-ryjm6ln","updated":"20251126113530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性能优化的主要学习路线为：定位问题 ——\u003e 分析问题 ——\u003e 解决问题\n学习这些对于我们的意义就是："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当项目出现性能问题时能够知道如何 发现 和 解决问题！"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n我们在解决性能问题时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不能够凭感觉去解决，而必须有据可依！（通过 Profiler 判断性能问题）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n并且当我们养成了良好的编程习惯和内存使用习惯后，往往只需要在出现性能问题时再去排查解决，不用过于敏感！"}]},{"ID":"20251126113357-9gmp736","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251126113357-9gmp736","updated":"20251126113420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通过学习各种性能分析工具的使用，再到 Unity 本身机制、CPU 性能、GPU 性能、内存问题等知识的学习\n其实我们发现，性能问题的本质就是根据需求去调整 “天平的平衡”\n我们的各种优化手段的本质，大多数时候就是：“用内存换性能”，“用 GPU 性能换 CPU 性能” 或者 “用性能换内存’"}]},{"ID":"20251126113423-3k5mzvs","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251126113423-3k5mzvs","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251126113423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251126113423-nu5lyub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251126113423-nu5lyub","updated":"20251126113449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：前提是养成了良好的编程习惯和内存使用习惯"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806125625-3460u2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806125625-3460u2h","updated":"20250806125632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本系列学习内容"}]},{"ID":"20250806125733-rskbpgy","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250806125733-rskbpgy","updated":"20251124160756"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806125755-u1ohawe","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806125755-u1ohawe","updated":"20250915113213"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806125755-i08vomk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806125755-i08vomk","updated":"20250903210620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250806125920-78g2d08","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Unity 性能分析工具"}]},{"ID":"20250806125837-cyb001k","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250806125837-cyb001k","updated":"20250915113213"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806125837-7lgqacc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806125837-7lgqacc","updated":"20250915113213"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806125837-bovbvwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806125837-bovbvwx","updated":"20250806131531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250806131531-oy2re0q","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Unity Profiler"}]}]},{"ID":"20250806125844-816bq5q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250806125844-816bq5q","updated":"20250912112544"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250806125844-5p58841","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250806125844-5p58841","updated":"20250912112544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20250912112544-jgkomga","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Unity Profiler 脚本控制"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250806125805-z9qf2h